---
// Full-screen storytelling beat: one large statement that lights up
// word-by-word as the visitor scrolls. Whitespace does the work.
---

<section class="stage" id="statement">
  <div class="stage-inner">
    <p class="stage-label mono" data-fade-late>01 — The idea</p>
    <p class="stage-statement" data-highlight>Build tools that understand your code, run on your machine, and keep your data yours.</p>
    <p class="stage-sub" data-fade-late>
      No accounts to feed, no telemetry to dodge. Software that starts
      fast and does what it says.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
